text: >-
  The Roommate.

  Police interviewed Robinson's roommate, a biological male who was involved in
  a

  romantic relationship with Robinson. The roommate told police that the
  roommate received

  messages from Robinson about the shooting and provided those messages to
  police.

  On September 10, 2025, the roommate received a text message from Robinson
  which said,

  "drop what you are doing, look under my keyboard." The roommate looked under
  the keyboard

  and found a note that stated, "I had the opportunity to take out Charlie Kirk
  and I'm going to take

  it." Police found a photograph of this note.

  The following text exchange then took place.

  7
